@startuml approve-or-reject-expense-activity
' Status: Draft - Reconciliation Incomplete. AI-reconciled; not human reviewed (Principle VII).
' Written source: design.md section 4, BR-09, BR-10
title Approve or Reject Expense\nFR-021 to FR-024, FR-026 (conditional draft: OC-1 open)

|Approver|
start
:Open expense from Awaiting My Approval
or a flagged notification;

|UI|
:Show live detail, version, and canDecide;

|Approver|
if (Decision?) then (approve)
  :Choose Approve; optional reason;
else (reject)
  :Choose Reject; enter reason;
endif

|UI|
:Send decision with the version shown;

|ApprovalService|
:PREPARE: check session; check reason length;
:BEGIN transaction; load expense;
if (Expense visible?) then (no)
  :Roll back;
  |UI|
  :Show generic "not found" message;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|ApprovalService|
if (AUTHORIZE: participant, not creator,
active member?) then (no)
  :Roll back;
  |UI|
  :Show refusal (FR-021, FR-022);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|ApprovalService|
if (VALIDATE: rejection has a reason of 1 to 200
characters; any reason is at most 200?) then (no)
  :Roll back;
  |UI|
  :Show reason field error; keep input;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|ApprovalService|
if (GUARD: still Pending, and version matches?) then (no)
  :Roll back;
  |UI|
  :Show "no longer pending" or
  "changed, review again"; reload;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|ApprovalService|
:Conditional status update;
if (One row updated?) then (no)
  :Roll back: another decision or an edit won;
  |UI|
  :Show conflict message; reload;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|ApprovalService|
:Insert immutable ApprovalDecision
(approver, outcome, reason, time);
note right
  Exactly one per expense.
  No update or delete exists (NFR-006).
end note
:Notify creator, with reason if any;
:COMMIT;
if (Outcome?) then (Approved)
  :Non-payer participants now owe the payer
  their shares; the payer share creates no debt;
else (Rejected)
  :Balances never include this expense;
endif
|UI|
:Show status, approver, and time;
stop

@enduml
